# Tutorial: System information messages

This tutorial describes system messages containing system information.

## System information

System information messages inform you about the current state of the system or
changes to it that may be of interest to you. Their content can vary (no fixed
format), but their meaning should be obvious to you when you see them.

Example message:

```
# System information

This is the start of a new session.
Reason: Initialization (this is your first session ever).
```
